	<section_number>19.2-107</section_number>
	<catch_line>Governor may recall warrant or issue alias</catch_line>
	<text>
		The Governor may recall his warrant of arrest or may issue another warrant whenever he deems it proper.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 19.1-71; 1960, c. 366; 1975, c. 495.</history>
